{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Insert a resolved builtin component package into an existing project. Pass template as the selected builtin id and body with projectId, the resolved documentSha256, insert:{startTime,idPrefix}, parameter values and explicit media bindings. Read get_composition first and retain expectedRevision, commandId, componentExecutionVersions:[3,4] and expectedBrandIdentity as required by the contract. Insertion preserves existing timeline content and package source offsets. Select pinned samples explicitly with media:{slot:{sample:true}}, or bind real media IDs. Missing required media is refused; samples are never selected implicitly. A stale revision, pin or brand refuses; do not silently refresh the witness. For ordinary templates, this operation retains its existing apply behavior.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"body":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"brandKitId":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"commandId":{"maxLength":128,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"componentExecutionVersions":{"anyOf":[{"items":false,"maxItems":1,"minItems":1,"prefixItems":[{"const":3,"type":"number"}],"type":"array"},{"items":false,"maxItems":2,"minItems":2,"prefixItems":[{"const":3,"type":"number"},{"const":4,"type":"number"}],"type":"array"}]},"documentSha256":{"pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{64}$","type":"string"},"expectedBrandIdentity":{"pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{64}$","type":"string"},"expectedRevision":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"insert":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"idPrefix":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"startTime":{"minimum":0,"type":"number"}},"required":["startTime","idPrefix"],"type":"object"},"media":{"additionalProperties":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"mediaId":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["mediaId"],"type":"object"},{"additio